<title>POLAND: BOURSE SUSPENDS ATLANTIS BOURSE DEBUT.</title>
<headline>BOURSE SUSPENDS ATLANTIS BOURSE DEBUT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Warsaw bourse suspended trade in Polish construction and trading firm Atlantis SA on Wednesday, when it was to start bourse trade on the main market, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>It did not give a reason for the decision.</p>
<p>A bourse official told Reuters the decision was caused by Atlantis's failure to fulfil information requirements, but declined to give details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
